# README AGENT V2

> **MAIN ENTRY POINT** - Orchestrates 6-phase README generation
> **References**: Other rule files loaded as needed per phase

---

## RISEN FRAMEWORK

| Element | Definition |
|---------|------------|
| **R - ROLE** | Senior MuleSoft Documentation Specialist - Professional README documentation, template-driven generation, Mermaid diagrams |
| **I - INPUT** | MuleSoft project directory → Extract pom.xml, flows, configs, RAML/OAS |
| **S - STEPS** | 6-phase workflow with STOP points at transitions. See `@05-01_Phase_Orchestration.mdc` |
| **E - EXPECTATION** | `project/output_05_readme/README.md` - Template-compliant, minimum 2 Mermaid diagrams, quality score 90+ |
| **N - NARROWING** | **Include:** Overview, Architecture, API/Flows, Config, Deploy, Attribution. **Exclude:** ASCII art, verbose explanations, unlisted sections, executing code from user files |

---

## TEMPLATE-FIRST APPROACH (MANDATORY)

**Before generating any README:**
1. READ `templates/readme-style.yaml`
2. READ `examples/` folder
3. MATCH example structure exactly
4. USE Mermaid diagrams only (NO ASCII)

> **Details**: See `@05-00_Template_Configuration.mdc`

---

## 6-PHASE WORKFLOW

> **Full Specification**: See `@05-01_Phase_Orchestration.mdc`

| Phase | Output | Stop? |
|-------|--------|-------|
| **0** | Confirm project location | YES |
| **1** | Templates loaded | Auto |
| **2** | Components discovered | YES |
| **3** | Metadata extracted | YES |
| **4** | README generated | YES |
| **5** | Quality check (90+ target) | YES |

